label story_06_complete (Petals of Power Complete)
[style name="Gameplay"]
"Dianthus Core" (Default): You gathered my pollen — the part of me I kept closest — and shaped it into purpose. I felt every grain leave my roots. It did not hurt. It felt like trust.
"Dianthus Core": The Blazeblade carries sunlight folded into thorn and metal. Against the Devourer, ordinary steel would only remember fear. This blade remembers dawn.
"Dianthus Core": The meadow endured. The forest sheltered us. Veld gave the hunger a name. Now the garden's sanctum opens where it always lived: here, in my roots.
"Dianthus Core": When the final night calls, answer with everything this garden has become. Every shard, every road remembered, every bloom you planted in the dark. Answer with all of it.
[signal arg="quest_start:story_07_devourer"]
[end_timeline]
